eties":{"evidence":"粉波旁 水洗","frames":["2s.png"],"raw":"粉波旁","sources":[],"status":"observed","value":["粉波旁"]},"varieties_english":{"evidence":"Therefore Coffee 与 Uncommon 均将哥伦比亚 Alexander Vargas 的 La Piragua 庄园咖啡品种列为 Pink Bourbon；ACE 官方记录同庄园品种为西班牙文 Bourbon Rosado，支持粉波旁的名称对应。","frames":["2s.png"],"raw":"粉波旁","sources":["https://therefore.coffee/products/alexander-vargas","https://uncommonams.com/products/la-piragua-colombia-pink-bourbon-natural"],"status":"inferred","value":[{"english":"Pink Bourbon","original":"粉波旁","sources":["https://therefore.coffee/products/alexander-vargas","https://uncommonams.com/products/la-piragua-colombia-pink-bourbon-natural"]}]}},"display":{"country":"哥伦比亚 Colombia","farm":"独木舟庄园","flavors":"","green_supplier":"","official_flavors":"","price_per_g":"","process":"水洗","process_category":"水洗","process_detail":"","product_name":"","region":"Huila Palestina","roast_date":"","roast_level":"浅烘","roaster":"CoffeeBuff","varieties":"[\"粉波旁\"]","varieties_english":"[{\"original\": \"粉波旁\", \"english\": \"Pink Bourbon\", \"sources\": [\"https://therefore.coffee/products/alexander-vargas\", \"https://uncommonams.com/products/la-piragua-colombia-pink-bourbon-natural\"]}]"},"id":33,"number":"B000033","photos":[],"recipe":{},"recipe_stage_display":[],"sources":[{"coffee_id":33,"created_at":"2026-11-05T05:33:41.083405+00:00","id":93,"kind":"video","raw_text":"【2s.png】\n哥伦比亚 独木舟庄园\n粉波旁 水洗\nF186\nColombia Huila La Piragua Pink Bourbon Washed\n浅度烘焙\n净含量:150克\n\nCoffeeBuff | 哥伦比亚 | 独木舟庄园\n粉波旁 | 水洗\n15g:241g，幻刺pro2+6(主要)+9\n94度，细粉快冲\n──────────\n比较成功，太好喝了\n\n【end_2s.png】\n无字幕；电子秤显示模糊，无法可靠逐字辨认。","video_id":50},{"coffee_id":33,"created_at":"2026-11-05T05:25:46.399913+00:00","id":88,"kind":"video","raw_text":"【2s.png】\nCoffeeBuff | 哥伦比亚 | 独木舟庄园\n粉波旁 | 水洗\n15g:246g，幻刺pro2+7+8，93度\nKalita Wave + 扇形滤纸，三段式\n────────\n首次尝试一下无旁通的设置\n感觉粘在墙上的粉不多，粘不住\n不过在这个设计下，粉粘墙上的意义\n就只剩下吸附细粉和美观了\n其实可以第二段的时候不绕那么大\n────────\n喝起来萃取率过大了\n酸很浓，甜只在低温有一些\n浸泡还是太久了\n下次尝试92度+直接两段\n\n【end_2s.png】\n无字幕。","video_id":45},{"coffee_id":33,"created_at":"2026-11-04T17:27:52.654430+00:00","id":66,"kind":"video","raw_text":"【2s.png】\nCoffeeBuff | 哥伦比亚 独木舟庄园\n粉波旁 | 水洗 | 1:16 | 93度\n幻刺pro2+6(主要)+8，细粉快冲\n──────────\n没到推介的养豆日期就开包了\n冲给国际同行喝\n刚出来的高温有点重\n中温没喝到，都给同行喝了\n低温很酸\n有可能是由于焖蒸的时候有通道\n摇晃了一下萃取率变高了\n下次保险磨6.5试试\n\n包装可辨文字：\n哥伦比亚 独木舟庄园\n粉波旁 水洗\nF186\n净含量:150克\n\n【end_2s.png】\n无字幕。","video_id":27}]}